      "content": "I'm not sure I'm fully buying the \"posturing\" angle. I've seen some chatter from our field contacts about irregular satellite imagery patterns near the northern staging areas and some unusual spikes in encrypted comms traffic in that sector. If we're seeing movement or an uptick in signal activity, shouldn't that be weighing more heavily on your assessment? Is there any specific data suggesting those reports are invalid?",
